WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.031
Actual M9 build. All accounts, courses and messages here are isolated synthetic fixtures, not university records.

2
00:00:03.031 --> 00:00:05.303
Reviewed courses use the existing publication workflow. Topics record coverage and confidence, not demonstrated mastery.

3
00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:07.358
The personal tab planner and focus timer still work offline. A separate account plan offers explicit saving across devices.

4
00:00:07.358 --> 00:00:09.568
Account plans use actual private API persistence. Changes are saved explicitly and conflicting device versions are rejected.

5
00:00:09.568 --> 00:00:11.854
Community remains a traditional group conversation with a persistent composer. Enter adds a line; the send arrow publishes.

6
00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:14.031
Website content suggestions use known public metadata. Freshness badges explicitly distinguish cached and unverified information.

7
00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:19.960
Restricted posting retains readable history and private assistance. The server enforces this policy.

8
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.843
Final preview: messaging is enabled through the real test administrator policy. New databases remain closed by default. Nothing is deployed.
